{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1968180/extras/1e7d3e6eaa087bf4354580153d72c424.poster.avif?t=1770298664\" width=600 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1968180/extras/1e7d3e6eaa087bf4354580153d72c424.webm?t=1770298664\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1968180/extras/1e7d3e6eaa087bf4354580153d72c424.mp4?t=1770298664\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Low wage. Exhaustion. Expensive fish and chips. Welcome to the United Kingdom.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >DIGGERGUN is an oppressive life sim platformer about workers, minimum pay and the environment. You\u2019re trapped on a blustery island, forced to work at Cornwall Mining Corp where it\u2019s shadier than the game\u2019s monochrome palette. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To escape, you need to earn \u00a33000 from digging precious lithium. To survive, you need to manage your time, energy and money during the rigid day-and-night cycle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you make ends meet while digging for freedom or find another way out and bring down the whole bloomin\u2019 system?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > An atmospheric world with fleshed-out characters; everyone you meet has their own distinct personality and storyline. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Multiple endings: who you interact with (or don\u2019t) will change the outcome of your story.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Unique energy system where your actions truly matter as the game tracks your gameplay and punishes/rewards you for your choices.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Life sim where wages, food, rent, and much more are based on the current cost-of-living in the United Kingdom. There's even a tax system calculated to real-world rates!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Diverse range of randomly generated mines and intricately hand-designed levels to ensure you\u2019re always kept on your toes.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"First Job","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1968180/97c08496fe7e207641dbfa198c88635cd833b638.jpg"},{"name":"Back For More","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1968180/7598850ea776a844a2343138db7b911ce61d1673.jpg"},{"name":"Found your DIGGERGUN!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1968180/8dbec9457501136f8a0b5e456249ee77d748519e.jpg"},{"name":"Lithium Collector","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1968180/e4ba343c2b1cc40bab86828d1df9e5470c10c535.jpg"},{"name":"Deposited Lithium","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1968180/a1a7e0c7d1e09ab0bc313be90b27843a65f838c6.jpg"},{"name":"Just A Scratch","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1968180/14932a16ce6ca9e067ebed92dbc5602f67762a59.jpg"},{"name":"Moneybags ","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1968180/96047cb5dc1dc464bf87bf4bec90585afe9115a3.jpg"},{"name":"Level Up","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1968180/d7f9c8ff6a1373fe2df8cb026dd97f99c309527d.jpg"},{"name":"Learning On The Job","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1968180/5aecdb7ed65d26e7349816683e1de433a4b3467c.jpg"},{"name":"DIGGERGUN Upgrade","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1968180/fe474e0452ae1ec706f26c59c9bf8d962e1f0937.jpg"}],"total":53},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1968180?t=1770298664","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1968180/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1770298664","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1968180/e57950f83d9a841a0b1393e878c8c6ac74887f1b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1770298664","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1968180/e57950f83d9a841a0b1393e878c8c6ac74887f1b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1770298664","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Trading Cards","id":29},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":2055420,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1968180/extras/1e7d3e6eaa087bf4354580153d72c424.poster.avif?t=1770298664\" width=600 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1968180/extras/1e7d3e6eaa087bf4354580153d72c424.webm?t=1770298664\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1968180/extras/1e7d3e6eaa087bf4354580153d72c424.mp4?t=1770298664\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Low wage. Exhaustion. Expensive fish and chips. Welcome to the United Kingdom.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >DIGGERGUN is an oppressive life sim platformer about workers, minimum pay and the environment. You\u2019re trapped on a blustery island, forced to work at Cornwall Mining Corp where it\u2019s shadier than the game\u2019s monochrome palette. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To escape, you need to earn \u00a33000 from digging precious lithium. To survive, you need to manage your time, energy and money during the rigid day-and-night cycle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you make ends meet while digging for freedom or find another way out and bring down the whole bloomin\u2019 system?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > An atmospheric world with fleshed-out characters; everyone you meet has their own distinct personality and storyline. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Multiple endings: who you interact with (or don\u2019t) will change the outcome of your story.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Unique energy system where your actions truly matter as the game tracks your gameplay and punishes/rewards you for your choices.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Life sim where wages, food, rent, and much more are based on the current cost-of-living in the United Kingdom. There's even a tax system calculated to real-world rates!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Diverse range of randomly generated mines and intricately hand-designed levels to ensure you\u2019re always kept on your toes.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Kabloop"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1968180/16f9acd720b1926d8ba0ea79d31d3